<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 01:45:01 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>2027 年 Coachella 音乐节阵容充满潜力，而且据称头条新闻被拒绝</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/speculative-coachella-2027-lineup-stacked-with-potential-plus-an-alleged-headliner-refusal/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;2027 年 Coachella 音乐节的传言已经满天飞，两名头条新闻入围，还有几位其他人正在争夺最后的头条位置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/speculative-coachella-2027-lineup-stacked-with-potential-plus-an-alleged-headliner-refusal/"&gt;2027 年 Coachella 音乐节后的推测阵容充满潜力，加上据称被拒绝的头条新闻，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:45:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/speculative-coachella-2027-lineup-stacked-with-potential-plus-an-alleged-headliner-refusal/</guid></item><item><title>2006 年 5 张最畅销专辑今年已经 20 岁了</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/5-best-selling-albums-of-2006-that-are-somehow-20-years-old-this-year/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;虽然感觉不太真实，但这五张专辑现在已经有 20 岁了。它们是2006年发行的五张最畅销专辑。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/5-best-selling-albums-of-2006-that-are-somehow-20-years-old-this-year/"&gt;2006 年 5 张最畅销专辑今年已有 20 岁了，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:28:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/5-best-selling-albums-of-2006-that-are-somehow-20-years-old-this-year/</guid></item><item><title>3 首超前于时代的垃圾摇滚歌曲</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-grunge-songs-that-were-ahead-of-their-time/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在西雅图次流行音乐在 90 年代凝固之前，许多早期的垃圾音乐在奠定基础的同时远远超前于时代。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-grunge-songs-that-were-ahead-of-their-time/"&gt;3 首超越时代的垃圾摇滚歌曲&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:25:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-grunge-songs-that-were-ahead-of-their-time/</guid></item><item><title>3 首让 Z 世代耳熟能详的 90 年代说唱歌曲</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-references-in-90s-rap-songs-that-would-fly-over-gen-zs-heads/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在 90 年代，这些说唱歌曲提到了 Z 世代听众耳熟能详的科技和流行文化事件。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-references-in-90s-rap-songs-that-would-fly-over-gen-zs-heads/"&gt;90 年代说唱歌曲中的 3 个引用将在 Z 世代的头脑中飞过，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:11:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-references-in-90s-rap-songs-that-would-fly-over-gen-zs-heads/</guid></item><item><title>《魔兽世界》发布重大更新，新增故事战役和单头目突袭</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/world-of-warcraft-reveals-major-update-with-new-story-campaign-and-single-boss-raid/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《魔兽世界》提供了下一个午夜重大更新的预告片，包括新的故事战役和单头目突袭。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/world-of-warcraft-reveals-major-update-with-new-story-campaign-and-single-boss-raid/"&gt;《魔兽世界》发布后的重大更新包括新故事战役和单头目突袭，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:51:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/world-of-warcraft-reveals-major-update-with-new-story-campaign-and-single-boss-raid/</guid></item><item><title>《龙与地下城》玩家获得《龙与地下城》地图之外的重大更新</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-players-get-a-big-update-to-dd-beyond-maps/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《龙与地下城》玩家现在可以查看最新的 D&amp;amp;D Beyond Maps 更新并测试新的日志功能。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-players-get-a-big-update-to-dd-beyond-maps/"&gt;龙与地下城玩家获得 D&amp;amp;D Beyond Maps 重大更新的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:35:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-players-get-a-big-update-to-dd-beyond-maps/</guid></item><item><title>如果这位屡获殊荣的 R&amp;amp;B 明星有自己的方式，德雷克将是同性恋</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-this-award-winning-rb-star-had-their-way-drake-would-be-gay/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在一次新的采访中，R&amp;amp;B 流行歌手蒂娜什表示，如果她可以选择任何一位同性恋艺术家，她会选择德雷克。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-this-award-winning-rb-star-had-their-way-drake-would-be-gay/"&gt;如果这位屡获殊荣的 R&amp;amp;B 明星有自己的方式，德雷克将成为同性恋，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:16:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-this-award-winning-rb-star-had-their-way-drake-would-be-gay/</guid></item><item><title>Xbox 刚刚宣布对主要游戏通行证订阅者福利的限制</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/xbox-just-announced-a-restriction-on-a-major-game-pass-subscriber-perk/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Xbox 正准备从 11 月开始限制 Game Pass 订阅福利中包含的云游戏小时数。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/xbox-just-announced-a-restriction-on-a-major-game-pass-subscriber-perk/"&gt;Xbox 刚刚宣布限制主要游戏通行证订户福利的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/xbox-just-announced-a-restriction-on-a-major-game-pass-subscriber-perk/</guid></item><item><title>我已经听过这张 Smashing Pumpkins 专辑一百万遍了，但它听起来从未像这张专辑那么好</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/ive-heard-this-smashing-pumpkins-album-a-million-times-but-its-never-sounded-quite-as-good-as-this/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;比利·柯根 (Billy Corgan) 在 60 名管弦乐队的伴奏下，在伦敦 30 周年巡演中表演了《梅隆牧羊犬和无限悲伤》。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/ive-heard-this-smashing-pumpkins-album-a-million-times-but-its-never-sounded-quite-as-good-as-this/"&gt;这张 Smashing Pumpkins 专辑我已经听过一百万遍了，但它听起来从来没有像这张专辑那么好，这篇&lt;/a&gt;文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:07:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/ive-heard-this-smashing-pumpkins-album-a-million-times-but-its-never-sounded-quite-as-good-as-this/</guid></item><item><title>热门 CD Projekt RED 游戏即将退出 Xbox Game Pass</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/popular-cd-projekt-red-game-is-leaving-xbox-game-pass/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Xbox Game Pass 将在几周内对其库进行调整，并且主要的 CD Projekt RED 游戏也将从该服务中轮换。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/popular-cd-projekt-red-game-is-leaving-xbox-game-pass/"&gt;热门 CD Projekt RED 游戏即将退出 Xbox Game Pass 的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 17:22:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/popular-cd-projekt-red-game-is-leaving-xbox-game-pass/</guid></item></channel></rss>